        <rule id="18aab417-2038-5df8-bccb-2f45d45440f9" name="Truffle Frenzy" hidden="false">
          <description>If within 8&quot; of a wood, field or marsh at the start of your Movement phase, roll a D6. On a 1 the unit must move its full Movement toward that feature; otherwise it gains +1 Movement this turn.</description>
