            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="ce9df1cd-97ab-506a-a2ce-e18d3c8cf504">0</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="982588a8-e9ec-5634-9d97-ecbbf0935460">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="f8c9ab42-a073-5459-8af1-aedff8b05c2b">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="216e778e-a6f9-53e0-86ae-399ccd2333c7">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="96eac4ff-a020-5797-b76d-118d30b45da2">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="da5ce416-0814-56f1-bffe-90d0e8264b80">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="bda7bfbc-019b-5f38-8ff0-63effc838e3b">-</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="b8028a39-c2a0-5c0a-be3d-2036c5ea7ece" name="Crew" hidden="false" typeId="6be2102c-91aa-54f9-aff0-8f6b92f6f9ae" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="bf96bcb3-be7d-5906-8588-3df6bab11836">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="7cca2aac-4f6e-5db7-a2ab-ef4aa5c6366f">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="ce9df1cd-97ab-506a-a2ce-e18d3c8cf504">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="982588a8-e9ec-5634-9d97-ecbbf0935460">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="f8c9ab42-a073-5459-8af1-aedff8b05c2b">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="216e778e-a6f9-53e0-86ae-399ccd2333c7">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="96eac4ff-a020-5797-b76d-118d30b45da2">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="da5ce416-0814-56f1-bffe-90d0e8264b80">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="bda7bfbc-019b-5f38-8ff0-63effc838e3b">6</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="6e74b87a-4f2a-5d8e-91c4-27531b120cb2" name="Great Cannon" hidden="false" typeId="66a5eec0-5ec5-52ee-9bf9-d19d7d735baf" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="R" typeId="1e547d7c-d536-58da-b3e4-95801380abb2">48&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="21ae8943-c4a1-5585-826d-53c15cdde4cf">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="39f009b6-8000-5606-aee9-33d8adfa4cf5">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="6e94c262-fd81-588c-8250-d1d2df58803c">Multiple Wounds (D3), bounces D6&quot; at S4. May only fire if the Harvester did not move.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="185cfcab-4354-5aa2-ba28-32d9135ec969" name="Big Gun (x2)" hidden="false" typeId="66a5eec0-5ec5-52ee-9bf9-d19d7d735baf" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="R" typeId="1e547d7c-d536-58da-b3e4-95801380abb2">24&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="21ae8943-c4a1-5585-826d-53c15cdde4cf">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="39f009b6-8000-5606-aee9-33d8adfa4cf5">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="6e94c262-fd81-588c-8250-d1d2df58803c">One shot each, fired at crew BS 4</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="2404caea-9a2a-5297-849a-510c19fa88fc" name="Big Gun - Case Shot" hidden="false" typeId="66a5eec0-5ec5-52ee-9bf9-d19d7d735baf" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="R" typeId="1e547d7c-d536-58da-b3e4-95801380abb2">12&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="21ae8943-c4a1-5585-826d-53c15cdde4cf">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="39f009b6-8000-5606-aee9-33d8adfa4cf5">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="6e94c262-fd81-588c-8250-d1d2df58803c">D6 hits, at half range or less</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="8c1e2175-d2cc-5801-8ce5-1faa2f6fd7fe" name="Threshing Blades" hidden="false">
          <description>In each round of close combat the Harvester makes D6 automatic hits at Strength 5 with Armour Piercing (2) against every enemy unit in base contact to its front.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="8f71582e-d185-54fd-b618-c5b93502d75e" name="Unreliable Contraption" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of each of your Movement phases roll a D6. On a 1 the Harvester does not move and suffers 1 wound with no saves permitted.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3fec7206-c035-5837-a6e8-a13d6355af07" name="One Good Wheel" hidden="false">
          <description>Only the right-hand wheel is driven. Any pivot or wheel to its right costs an additional 2&quot; of Movement, and it may not turn more than 45 degrees to its right in a single Movement phase. It may not turn right at all in a turn it Marches. If declaring a charge would require it to turn more than 45 degrees to its right to make contact, it may not declare that charge.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="62d2510c-72bc-5e86-9611-4c142d4c304c" name="Hard to Port" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of its Movement phase, before moving, the Harvester may pivot up to 90 degrees to its left at no cost in Movement. Wheels and pivots to its left made during a move cost no additional Movement. When declaring a charge it may pivot a further 45 degrees to its left to make contact, even if it has already wheeled left. When it pursues, overruns or makes a compulsory move it may pivot up to 45 degrees to its left first, redirecting into a different target if one lies that way. Recoil and backwards shunts ignore both steering rules.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="dee7cc89-b233-5a05-9452-a17fe1aa4915" name="The Gun Deck" hidden="false">
          <description>Declare which of the three barrels fire; each may target a different unit. Before firing the Great Cannon, roll a D6: on a 1 it misfires. If both Big Guns fire in the same phase, roll a D6 for the second: on a 1 it does not fire and misfires instead.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ede14fda-c4e5-5b7f-9d5d-fff89f619dc4" name="Recoil" hidden="false">
          <description>When the Great Cannon fires, the Harvester is shunted D3&quot; directly backwards, resolved after the shot. The Big Guns do not shunt it. If the shunt would take the Harvester into another unit, into impassable terrain or off the table, it stops 1&quot; short and suffers 1 wound with no saves permitted.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="a07fa8b7-1b5e-58df-8779-3a044466d75a" name="Bouncing Platform" hidden="false">
          <description>The Big Guns suffer -1 To Hit in a turn the Harvester moved. The Harvester may not fire anything in a turn it charged.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ae5818fe-4ee6-5c08-9ac3-0487b1cb6633" name="Threshing Misfire Table" hidden="false">
          <description>D6: 1 Boiler Rupture - D3 wounds, no saves, and it may neither move nor shoot next turn. 2 Barrel Bursts - that gun is wrecked for the rest of the game and the Harvester suffers 1 wound, no saves. 3 Fouled with Straw - that gun may not fire in your next Shooting phase. 4 Backfire - the Harvester suffers 1 wound, no saves, but the gun is undamaged. 5 Wild Shot - resolve that gun's shot against the nearest unit within 12&quot;, friend or foe, hitting automatically. 6 She Holds! - no effect, the gun fires as normal and may re-roll its To Hit roll.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="39b77e01-145a-52f6-a8f3-3d9cda72002d" name="Impact Hits (D6+1)" hidden="false">
          <description>Standard rules apply.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ef529265-2dc9-5eb0-8a66-1e7fcf1fec39" name="Terror" hidden="false">
          <description>Standard rules apply.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="041bba7a-1b8d-5804-9cd5-d6cc588c4f5b" name="Large Target" hidden="false">
          <description>Standard rules apply. Armour Value 5+.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="304cdf6d-7b01-5b74-80ec-318f388e8ae1" value="215"/>
      </costs>
